  "details": "I realy would like to be able to create/read/manage the vr chat world/avatar cache. This could be helpful for realising something like resource packs. As example lets say we have a world A that uses a quite big amount of high quality textures. And now assume we made another world using the same textures. For now we have to download them again but this is not nessesary. It also could be helpful to make these independent from worlds to as example make optional dependecies possible. Also they could be categorized in public resources and private with the public ones being downloadable an usable from any world and creator and the private ones being only accessible by its creator.",
